WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.330
Good morning, Chic Boutique, How may I

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.660
help you?

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:21.090
I'd like to speak to Mr Morgan please.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.180
Who's calling please? This is John Wright

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:26.789
from International Fashion Supplies.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:27.449
Sorry, I didn't catch your name. John

00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:32.669
Wright.

00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:35.230
That's W.RI.G.H.T. Okay Mr Wright. I'll try

00:00:32.669 --> 00:00:38.350
and put you through.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:41.280
I'm afraid the line's engaged would you

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:44.500
like to hold? Uh, can I leave a message?

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:46.089
Certainly. Could you please tell Mr

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:48.399
Morgan our latest shipment has been

00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:49.989
delayed and that the 300 dresses he

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:54.239
ordered should arrive next Friday.

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:56.769
Dress order delayed ... arriving next Friday.

00:00:54.239 --> 00:00:58.299
Yes, and would you please ask him to give

00:00:56.769 --> 00:01:00.760
me a call as soon as the shipment

00:00:58.299 --> 00:01:02.140
arrives? Of course. Could you let me have

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:05.530
your number please?

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:09.069
Yes, it's zero one six three two nine six

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:12.450
zero double nine four. That's oh one six

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:15.280
three two nine six oh double nine four.

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:18.929
Yes, that's right. Thanks for your help.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:18.929
Goodbye. Goodbye.

